{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/582074-demon-the-descent-on-youtube","id":582074,"title":"Demon the Descent on Youtube","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-07T03:31:30-07:00","id":582074,"title":"Demon the Descent on Youtube","content":"Hello fellow denizens of hell and between, it is I again you're psychotic cannibal. I'm just here to let you know that I have recently taken it upon myself to bring some demon young into the world, and start teaching them the ropes. I'm even recording it;<br /> <br /> The given link is a view to the playlist where the videos are being posted, please enjoy.<br /> <br /> Just a fair warning, the first session's audio is kinda crap, XSplit doesn't like multiple people talking into it, but the next session will be recorded using OBS, which has been tested to have better quality when recording multiple people.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4565,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4565-zeriqharuk","user":"ZeriqHaruk","date":". 07-07-2015, 06:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4565-zeriqharuk","name":"ZeriqHaruk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-07T11:58:08-07:00","id":582595,"title":"","content":"You are braver than we, putting the audio up heh. Never could talk any of my groups into it. Possibly because several of us are pottymouths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"co