 of others that I do what I must do. Plus it's the only Demon the Descent game that's been uploaded onto youtube, and I thought to myself that that is not right, and must be righted... too bad it had to be the resident cannibal huh?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4565-zeriqharuk","name":"ZeriqHaruk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-07T18:41:58-07:00","id":582975,"title":"","content":"Brave is not the word I would use bat shit crazy seems more the right feel.What are you talking about Zeriq we talk like sailors.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6825-mrkorosu","name":"MrKorosu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T12:22:59-07:00","id":583741,"title":"","content":"About halfway through episode 1 (Solo with Seraph), its good to hear a Demon game in audio. Between this, my own game and Barons AP I can compare some differences in play styles and perceptions of the game. <br /> <br /> One question though, you had 1s subtracting successes, that's not a rule in nWoD (it was in cWoD), if you don't mind, might ask why you thought it should be added?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-08T23:31:09-07:00","id":584295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElvesofZion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/582074-demon-the-descent-on-youtube?p=583741#post583741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">About halfway through episode 1 (Solo with Seraph), its good to hear a Demon game in audio. Between this, my own game and Barons AP I can compare some differences in play styles and perceptions of the game.<br /> <br /> One question though, you had 1s subtracting successes, that's not a rule in nWoD (it was in cWoD), if you don't mind, might ask why you thought it should be added?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's just how I've been playing it, gm started me with the rule and I didn't think anything of it due to it being an interesting rule... and needed when the dice pools start to get a little whacky.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4565-zeriqharuk","name":"ZeriqHaruk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-09T09:51:23-07:00","id":584843,"title":"","content":"Ok then, it will be interesting to hear how it plays out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-12T16:27:37-07:00","id":588539,"title":"","content":"Good luck<br /> <br /> Also what is your recording setup asking because I waa thinking of recording a tabletop series","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxrkv14ojD_TQXU0RBvF33Q\" target=\"_blank\">Fool's Corner Productions</a>: Where we review Video Game, and eventually tabletop RPGs<br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/u/7019410/Images/Ex3%20KS%20Badge.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img31/2512/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/461-kingcarnival","name":"KingCarnival","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar461_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"170"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-13T18:10:48-07:00","id":589706,"title":"","content":"I'm currently testing different recorders to see which is best, but Gamecaster of XSplit isn't that good since it starts to lower volume in other places depending on the mic volume, but Broadcaster of XSplit seems to be okay. BandiCam is also an option, just know the free version has audio popping. OBS which is the only safe free option is by far the best, but doesn't have one thing the other three have; A timer for when to split recordings. And in the middle of the game, breaks immersion if you have to remember to stop and then start the recording. All depends on your budget and what you prefer, just don't use Gamecaster for the mentioned reason, it is good for gameplay videos.<br /> <br /> For rendering the videos, as they do have a video feed while recording, I put them into a free software called blender. Remove the video feed, keep audio, then use a static image for the entire length of the audio. I don't have anything for fixing audio issues... which is why the first session was crap in audio quality xD","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4565-zeriqharuk","name":"ZeriqHaruk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T02:57:44-07:00","id":594603,"title":"","content":"The second session has just concluded with the recording, rendering shall commence, and the next set of videos will be uploaded soon. We're using OBS instead of XSplit for this recording, and the audio came out amazing imo, so I hope you all will find them to be easier to enjoy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4565-zeriqharuk","name":"ZeriqHaruk","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4565_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-24T15:57:16-07:00","id":638425,"title":"","content":"I've listened to your games and I was wondering, would it be possible to join this group of yours? Better yet, would you like to take a look at our group?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 08-24-2015, 07:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}